                    border: Border.all(color: isDark ? const Color(0x335B6B88) : const Color(0x221D4ED8)),
                  ),
                  child: Row(
                    mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
                    children: [
                      Icon(
                        Icons.business_center_rounded,
